{"id":"1f6aee9023988355","group":"58","path":"58/batch14/58-df-projective-cover.md","title":"Projective Cover","display":"df-projective-cover — Projective Cover","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-projective-cover","aliases":["58-df-projective-cover"],"display":"df-projective-cover — Projective Cover","depends_on":["[[../batch17/58-df-projective-module.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-module.md]]","[[../batch07/58-df-submodule.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch05/58-df-surjective.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-projective-cover"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-projective-cover</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-projective-cover — Projective Cover"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"427dbff531db1052\" href=\"?note=427dbff531db1052\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-projective-module.md\">../batch17/58-df-projective-module.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ef3a5dd6825f0373\" href=\"?note=ef3a5dd6825f0373\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-module.md\">../batch13/58-df-module.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4deff85a84639467\" href=\"?note=4deff85a84639467\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-submodule.md\">../batch07/58-df-submodule.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"9f8cb046321ba311\" href=\"?note=9f8cb046321ba311\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-surjective.md\">../batch05/58-df-surjective.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R,M,P,\\pi\\in V\">\\(R,M,P,\\pi\\in V\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Module}_S\\subseteq V^9\">\\(\\mathrm{Module}_S\\subseteq V^9\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Projective}\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\operatorname{Projective}\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"ef3a5dd6825f0373\" href=\"?note=ef3a5dd6825f0373\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-module.md\">../batch13/58-df-module.md</a>, <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"427dbff531db1052\" href=\"?note=427dbff531db1052\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-projective-module.md\">../batch17/58-df-projective-module.md</a>).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Submodule}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{Submodule}_S\\)</span> is the structured submodule predicate from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"4deff85a84639467\" href=\"?note=4deff85a84639467\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-submodule.md\">../batch07/58-df-submodule.md</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function},\\operatorname{Surjective}\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{Function},\\operatorname{Surjective}\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>, <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"9f8cb046321ba311\" href=\"?note=9f8cb046321ba311\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-surjective.md\">../batch05/58-df-surjective.md</a>).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ProjectiveCover}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\operatorname{ProjectiveCover}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{HasProjectiveCover}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\operatorname{HasProjectiveCover}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}projective\\text{-}cover}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\operatorname{ProjectiveCover}_S(\\pi,P,M,R)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists +_P,0_P,+_M,0_M,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot_P,\\odot_M\\in V\\;\\Bigl[\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{Module}_S(P,R,+_P,0_P,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot_P)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Module}_S(M,R,+_M,0_M,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot_M)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\operatorname{Projective}(P,R)\\land\\operatorname{Surjective}(\\pi,P,M)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x,y\\in P\\;\\forall r\\in R\\;\\Bigl(\n\\pi(+_P(\\langle x,y\\rangle))=+_M(\\langle\\pi(x),\\pi(y)\\rangle)\n\\land\\pi(\\odot_P(\\langle r,x\\rangle))=\\odot_M(\\langle r,\\pi(x)\\rangle)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\operatorname{Submodule}_S\\bigl(\\{p\\in P\\mid\\pi(p)=0_M\\};P,R,+_P,0_P,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot_P\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall L\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{Submodule}_S(L;P,R,+_P,0_P,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot_P)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\{+_P(\\langle k,\\ell\\rangle)\\mid k\\in P\\land\\pi(k)=0_M\\land\\ell\\in L\\}=P\n\\to L=P\\Bigr)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}projective\\text{-}cover}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\operatorname{ProjectiveCover}_S(\\pi,P,M,R)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists +_P,0_P,+_M,0_M,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot_P,\\odot_M\\in V\\;\\Bigl[\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{Module}_S(P,R,+_P,0_P,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot_P)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Module}_S(M,R,+_M,0_M,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot_M)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\operatorname{Projective}(P,R)\\land\\operatorname{Surjective}(\\pi,P,M)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x,y\\in P\\;\\forall r\\in R\\;\\Bigl(\n\\pi(+_P(\\langle x,y\\rangle))=+_M(\\langle\\pi(x),\\pi(y)\\rangle)\n\\land\\pi(\\odot_P(\\langle r,x\\rangle))=\\odot_M(\\langle r,\\pi(x)\\rangle)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\operatorname{Submodule}_S\\bigl(\\{p\\in P\\mid\\pi(p)=0_M\\};P,R,+_P,0_P,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot_P\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall L\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{Submodule}_S(L;P,R,+_P,0_P,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot_P)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\{+_P(\\langle k,\\ell\\rangle)\\mid k\\in P\\land\\pi(k)=0_M\\land\\ell\\in L\\}=P\n\\to L=P\\Bigr)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}has\\text{-}projective\\text{-}cover} \\vdash\n\\operatorname{HasProjectiveCover}_S(M,R) \\leftrightarrow \\exists P,\\pi\\in V\\;\\operatorname{ProjectiveCover}_S(\\pi,P,M,R)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}has\\text{-}projective\\text{-}cover} \\vdash\n\\operatorname{HasProjectiveCover}_S(M,R) \\leftrightarrow \\exists P,\\pi\\in V\\;\\operatorname{ProjectiveCover}_S(\\pi,P,M,R)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Projective covers are dual to injective hulls.</li>\n<li>Not every module has a projective cover (rings without the lifting property).</li>\n<li>The kernel condition is smallness (superfluity), not essentiality; essential submodules occur in injective hulls.</li>\n<li>Smallness is expanded against every structured submodule <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\leq_RP\">\\(L\\leq_RP\\)</span>; the former <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SmallSubmodule}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{SmallSubmodule}_S\\)</span> and unary <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ker\">\\(\\ker\\)</span> had no source.</li>\n<li>The radical <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rad}(P)\">\\(\\mathrm{Rad}(P)\\)</span> is the intersection of all maximal submodules of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch17/58-df-projective-module.md","status":"resolved","id":"427dbff531db1052","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-projective-module.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-module.md","status":"resolved","id":"ef3a5dd6825f0373","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-module.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-submodule.md","status":"resolved","id":"4deff85a84639467","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-submodule.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-surjective.md","status":"resolved","id":"9f8cb046321ba311","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-surjective.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-module.md","status":"resolved","id":"ef3a5dd6825f0373","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Module}_S\\subseteq V^9$ and $\\operatorname{Projective}\\subseteq V^2$ (see [[../batch13/58-df-module.md]], [[../batch17/58-df-projective-module.md]]).","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-projective-module.md","status":"resolved","id":"427dbff531db1052","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Module}_S\\subseteq V^9$ and $\\operatorname{Projective}\\subseteq V^2$ (see [[../batch13/58-df-module.md]], [[../batch17/58-df-projective-module.md]]).","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-submodule.md","status":"resolved","id":"4deff85a84639467","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Submodule}_S$ is the structured submodule predicate from [[../batch07/58-df-submodule.md]].","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function},\\operatorname{Surjective}\\subseteq V^3$ (see [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]], [[../batch05/58-df-surjective.md]]).","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-surjective.md","status":"resolved","id":"9f8cb046321ba311","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function},\\operatorname{Surjective}\\subseteq V^3$ (see [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]], [[../batch05/58-df-surjective.md]]).","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"R,M,P,\\pi\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Module}_S\\subseteq V^9","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Projective}\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Submodule}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function},\\operatorname{Surjective}\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ProjectiveCover}_S\\subseteq V^4","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{HasProjectiveCover}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}projective\\text{-}cover}\\vdash{}&\n\\operatorname{ProjectiveCover}_S(\\pi,P,M,R)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\exists +_P,0_P,+_M,0_M,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot_P,\\odot_M\\in V\\;\\Bigl[\\\\\n&\\mathrm{Module}_S(P,R,+_P,0_P,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot_P)\\\\\n&\\land\\mathrm{Module}_S(M,R,+_M,0_M,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot_M)\\\\\n&\\land\\operatorname{Projective}(P,R)\\land\\operatorname{Surjective}(\\pi,P,M)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall x,y\\in P\\;\\forall r\\in R\\;\\Bigl(\n\\pi(+_P(\\langle x,y\\rangle))=+_M(\\langle\\pi(x),\\pi(y)\\rangle)\n\\land\\pi(\\odot_P(\\langle r,x\\rangle))=\\odot_M(\\langle r,\\pi(x)\\rangle)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&\\land\\operatorname{Submodule}_S\\bigl(\\{p\\in P\\mid\\pi(p)=0_M\\};P,R,+_P,0_P,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot_P\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall L\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{Submodule}_S(L;P,R,+_P,0_P,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot_P)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\{+_P(\\langle k,\\ell\\rangle)\\mid k\\in P\\land\\pi(k)=0_M\\land\\ell\\in L\\}=P\n\\to L=P\\Bigr)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}has\\text{-}projective\\text{-}cover} \\vdash\n\\operatorname{HasProjectiveCover}_S(M,R) \\leftrightarrow \\exists P,\\pi\\in V\\;\\operatorname{ProjectiveCover}_S(\\pi,P,M,R)","display":true},{"tex":"L\\leq_RP","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{SmallSubmodule}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\ker","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Rad}(P)","display":false},{"tex":"P","display":false}],"bytes":2620,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1000","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-projective-cover.md|58-df-projective-cover]]（batch14）"}],"outgoing":["427dbff531db1052","ef3a5dd6825f0373","4deff85a84639467","36d7463d215be751","9f8cb046321ba311"]}